Air's not so bad. Resist the urge to quaff all your PoFH after
alchemising; keep a dozen or so around. Against straight-up pounding, a
PoFH is as good as an AoLS.

Beyond that, the trick on Air is not to fight. Find the portal and zoom
straight towards it; don't enter the clouds unless you have free action,
but otherwise make a beeline. Use WoTele to get the press out of your way;
you will get stuck in the occasional air elemental, but you should be able
to pound them down. If your HP drop, try and get swallowed by a harmless
vortex and rest up inside it.
